    mctp_set_i32⦅leaf_ptr ⸴ ep⦆ ·
    int64 four ↦ 4 ·
    int64 eight ↦ 8 ·
    int64 w_hash_ptr ↦ leaf_ptr ⊕ four ·
    when ws ≻ 0 ⟦
        qadav_sha3_256⦅w_ptr ⸴ ws ⸴ w_hash_ptr⦆ ·
    ⟧
    when ws ≼ 0 ⟦
        qadav_sha3_256⦅leaf_ptr ⸴ four ⸴ w_hash_ptr⦆ ·
