    ⟧
    int64 seventy_two ↦ 72 ·
    int64 loss_ptr ↦ leaf_ptr ⊕ seventy_two ·
    mctp_store⦅loss_ptr ⸴ ls⦆ ·
    int64 eighty ↦ 80 ·
    int64 hp_hash_ptr ↦ leaf_ptr ⊕ eighty ·
    qadav_sha3_256⦅leaf_ptr ⸴ eight ⸴ hp_hash_ptr⦆ ·
    int64 next_n ↦ n ⊕ 1 ·
    mctp_set_i32⦅c ⸴ next_n⦆ ·
    yield 1 ·
⟧

process mctp_record_epochs_loop⦅int64 c ⸴ int64 epochs ⸴ int64 w_ptr ⸴ int64 ws ⸴ int64 d_ptr ⸴ int64 ds ⸴ int64 init_ls⦆ → int64 ⟦
    when epochs ≼ 0 ⟦
